#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:7
#: c184ee43485940b086aec566afee7ee4
msgid ""
"The Snapdragon Flight platform is a high performance CPU autopilot with a "
"two onboard cameras."
msgstr "Snapdragon Flight 平台是一款高性能 CPU 飞控，板载两个摄像头。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:14
#: ab06725ebe8c4549a0388c464add07ed
msgid ""
"Numerous developers have reported this board is difficult to get working "
"perhaps because of a lack of documentation or issues with underlying "
"software on the board. If you are looking for a high performance Linux "
"autopilot, you may wish to consider the :ref:`Navio2 <common-"
"navio2-overview>` instead."
msgstr ""
"众多开发者反映该板难以正常工作，可能是由于文档不足或板载底层软件存在问题。如果您正在寻找高性能 Linux 飞控，可以考虑 :ref:`Navio2 "
"<common-navio2-overview>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:17
#: cdbbef730337433ca37ce5bbbbffcf83
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:19
#: 4dc4517d85084fbab91812395e8dbed3
msgid ""
"The `Qualcomm® Snapdragon Flight™ Kit (Developer’s Edition) "
"<http://shop.intrinsyc.com/products/snapdragon-flight-dev-kit>`__ is small "
"(58x40mm) but offers a lot of CPU power and two on-board cameras. It "
"contains 4 ‘Krait’ ARM cores which run Linux (Ubuntu 14.04 Trusty, by "
"default), and 3 ‘Hexagon’ DSP cores which run the QURT RTOS. In addition it "
"includes Wi-Fi, Bluetooth connectivity, automotive-grade GPS and many more "
"features."
msgstr ""
"`Qualcomm® Snapdragon Flight™ "
"Kit（开发者版）<http://shop.intrinsyc.com/products/snapdragon-flight-dev-kit>`__ "
"体积小巧（58x40mm），但提供强大的 CPU 性能和两个板载摄像头。它包含 4 个运行 Linux（默认为 Ubuntu 14.04 "
"Trusty）的「Krait」ARM 内核，以及 3 个运行 QURT RTOS 的「Hexagon」DSP 内核。此外还集成了 Wi-"
"Fi、蓝牙连接、车规级 GPS 等更多功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:28
#: ef42b32a8b41408b9fcf9b7f68b96bce
msgid ""
"Due to some rather unusual licensing terms from Intrinsyc we cannot "
"distribute binaries of ArduPilot (or any program built with the Qualcomm "
"libraries). So you will have to build the firmware yourself: :ref:`Building "
"for Qualcomm Snapdragon Flight Kit <dev:building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-"
"flight-kit>` (Dev Wiki)."
msgstr ""
"由于 Intrinsyc 的特殊许可条款，我们无法分发 ArduPilot（或任何使用 Qualcomm "
"库构建的程序）的二进制文件。因此您需要自行编译固件：:ref:`为 Qualcomm Snapdragon Flight Kit 构建 "
"<dev:building-for-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit>`（开发 Wiki）。"

