#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:105
#: a725d5ef39654d6ab3e2c329304ae41a
msgid ""
"The 4 ports are called **/dev/tty-1**, **/dev/tty-2**, **/dev/tty-3** and "
"**/dev/tty-4**. The first port is the one closest to the USB3 connector. The"
" ports proceed counter-clockwise from there. So tty-2 is the one closest to "
"the power connector."
msgstr ""
"4 个接口分别称为 **/dev/tty-1**、**/dev/tty-2**、**/dev/tty-3** 和 "
"**/dev/tty-4**。第一个接口最靠近 USB3 接口，其余接口从那里逆时针排列。因此 tty-2 最靠近电源接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:110
#: 07e5e46f77a54054b5d6bfe6f7047ec5
msgid "The *default assignment* of the ports is:"
msgstr "各接口的*默认分配*为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:112
#: 6341cc8d2d9f43768e562dc87382900c
msgid "**/dev/tty-1**: RC input (Spektrum satellite only)"
msgstr "**/dev/tty-1**：RC 输入（仅 Spektrum 卫星接收机）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:113
#: 4220529a6d3748b588fc32ae0b2c9fb5
msgid "**/dev/tty-2**: telemetry at 57600"
msgstr "**/dev/tty-2**：57600 波特率数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:114
#: 6ed770df20a44ad3a7de5b7a7fd65fd2
msgid "**/dev/tty-3**: RC output (see below)"
msgstr "**/dev/tty-3**：RC 输出（见下文）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:115
#: 293daec1bcee488f8cf5eacad75d1538
msgid "**/dev/tty-4**: GPS"
msgstr "**/dev/tty-4**：GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:117
#: 69179f8e0bf040da9a59d054cdee6452
msgid ""
"3 of the 4 ports provide 3.3V power on **pin1**, while the **/dev/tty-1** "
"provides 5V power (note that **pin6** is not ground, unlike on a Pixhawk). "
"You will need to check whether your GPS can be powered off 3.3V. A uBlox GPS"
" is recommended, although any ArduPilot compatible serial GPS can be used."
msgstr ""
"4 个接口中有 3 个在**引脚 1** 提供 3.3V 电源，而 **/dev/tty-1** 提供 5V 电源（注意**引脚 6** 不是地线，与 "
"Pixhawk 不同）。您需要确认您的 GPS 是否可以由 3.3V 供电。推荐使用 uBlox GPS，但任何 ArduPilot 兼容的串口 GPS"
" 均可使用。"

