#: 50f3b2a7d39b437da069aa9b814d0afe
msgid "ESC PWM Output"
msgstr "ESC PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:349
#: 36ed14769ed649c99507548defb7cc44
msgid ""
"To get signals to ESCs or servos you need to use a UART. The default setup "
"is to send 4 PWM signals as serial data on **/dev/tty-3**."
msgstr "要向 ESC 或舵机发送信号，需要使用 UART。默认设置是在 **/dev/tty-3** 上以串行数据形式发送 4 路 PWM 信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:352
#: 1a0ad4815a754c3f8588750aaf9b4c38
msgid ""
"`This firmware <https://github.com/tridge/ardupilot/tree/hal-"
"qurt/libraries/RC_Channel/examples/RC_UART>`__ will read the UART serial "
"stream and output to the PWM output of the board you use. For example, you "
"could use a Pixracer or Pixhawk board. It is designed to work with this "
"firmware for any ArduPilot compatible board."
msgstr ""
"`此固件 <https://github.com/tridge/ardupilot/tree/hal-"
"qurt/libraries/RC_Channel/examples/RC_UART>`__ 将读取 UART 串行流并输出到您所用板的 PWM "
"输出。例如，可以使用 Pixracer 或 Pixhawk 板。它设计为与任何 ArduPilot 兼容板的固件配合使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:360
#: 8c5db8cd81c341868a7b66d288607dbe
msgid ""
"`Qualcomm/Intrinsyc have released a ESC "
"<https://shop.intrinsyc.com/products/qualcomm-electronic-speed-control-"
"board>`__ for use with this board but it has not been tested for use with "
"ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"`Qualcomm/Intrinsyc 已发布一款 ESC <https://shop.intrinsyc.com/products/qualcomm-"
"electronic-speed-control-board>`__ 供该板使用，但尚未经过 ArduPilot 兼容性测试。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:363
#: 404e928f10fb4cbfb1139ae26d98dc44
msgid "Logging"
msgstr "日志"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:365
#: c5acd24f1d6945d7aba35a7f2c45033c
msgid ""
"Logs will appear in **/var/APM/logs** for QFLIGHT ARM port and in "
"**/usr/share/data/adsp/logs** for the QURT port."
msgstr ""
"日志将出现在 QFLIGHT ARM 版本的 **/var/APM/logs** 中，以及 QURT 版本的 "
"**/usr/share/data/adsp/logs** 中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:368
#: 685a7da62d944683b1001703d76756d3
msgid ""
"You can copy the logs over WiFi using FTP, Samba, SCP or any other common "
"file copying tool (the board runs Samba by default, so you can just add the "
"log directory to the Samba config file to export it, and then drag and drop "
"from Windows). On QFLIGHT you can also download logs over MAVLink."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过 WiFi 使用 FTP、Samba、SCP 或其他常见文件复制工具复制日志（该板默认运行 Samba，因此您只需将日志目录添加到 Samba"
" 配置文件中即可导出，然后从 Windows 拖放）。在 QFLIGHT 上，还可以通过 MAVLink 下载日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:375
#: 69bf7ca28ede4e24af8347aaa3f70b16
msgid "Record and display live video"
msgstr "录制和显示实时视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:377
#: ab870f8eb3d74781a47ac05c6d9da1c9
msgid ""
"Recording and viewing live video from either of the two cameras is possible "
"using the qcamvid application on the autopilot."
msgstr "可以使用飞控上的 qcamvid 应用程序从两个摄像头中的任意一个录制和查看实时视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:380
#: a909e70236664913a8618904c9d4a2bf
msgid ""
"Connect the ground station computer to the autopilot's wifi network "
"(normally appears as *Atlanticus_XXXX*)"
msgstr "将地面站计算机连接到飞控的 WiFi 网络（通常显示为 *Atlanticus_XXXX*）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:382
#: 2f54cddcba6f4ccf813f2366bffc5635
msgid ""
"Use an ssh program such as `Putty "
"<https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/latest.html>`__ to login"
" into the board"
msgstr ""
"使用 SSH 程序（如 `Putty "
"<https://www.chiark.greenend.org.uk/~sgtatham/putty/latest.html>`__）登录到飞控板"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:385
#: 8c34a95895a44703a22ea727afafe914
msgid ""
"Type the following to record 10 minutes of video from the front camera to "
"/root/video.h264 (other options can be seen by typing ``qcamvid -h``)"
msgstr ""
"输入以下命令，从前置摄像头录制 10 分钟视频到 /root/video.h264（其他选项可通过输入 ``qcamvid -h`` 查看）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:393
#: 46aea932ccaa48c59dfb0ea088843262
msgid ""
"The video can also be viewed in real-time by installing a program such as "
"`VLC media player <http://www.videolan.org/vlc/index.html>`__ on the ground "
"station computer, and then opening the following network stream."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过在地面站计算机上安装 `VLC 媒体播放器 <http://www.videolan.org/vlc/index.html>`__ "
"等程序，然后打开以下网络流来实时查看视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-qualcomm-snapdragon-flight-kit.rst:405
#: 2086a98e62a14c3abe33aaec9935320f
msgid "VLC Media Player: Stream Live Video"
msgstr "VLC 媒体播放器：实时视频流"

